    rdfs:comment "Patient has met or plateaued on rehabilitation goals. Long-term functional level is established. ALF is the appropriate next-phase living environment. Family meeting is the first and primary step — ALF placement is a major life decision requiring genuine family/proxy engagement before administrative processes proceed. Sequence: clinical goal certification → family meeting → payer/financial confirmation → care plan transfer → ALF bed → transport." ;
