    rdfs:label "Transfer Blocked — Administrative or Clinical Barrier" ;
    rdfs:comment "A barrier is raised during the planned transfer authorization process, preventing transfer execution. Common causes: payer authorization denied (peer-to-peer review initiated), receiving facility at capacity (waitlist activated), family objection requiring mediation, patient clinical deterioration requiring higher level of care than planned destination, missing legal documentation (no healthcare proxy, contested POA), or bed-hold lapse." ;
